UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 265.A12, the prudent official test asks whether a reasonable person relying on the financial statements would be influenced by the potential misstatement that the deficiency could allow. This focuses on the significance of the potential impact to financial statement users, not on management''s remediation efforts.
Wrong (B): Management''s response to remediate the deficiency is a separate consideration. The prudent official test evaluates the deficiency''s significance, not whether management has acted on it.
Wrong (C): Whether the deficiency was previously reported does not address the prudent official standard, which focuses on the deficiency''s potential impact on financial statement users.
