-- Q5014: Misstatements and Control Deficiencies [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 450.05-.06, the auditor accumulates all identified misstatements other than those that are clearly trivial. This accumulated listing, commonly called the summary of uncorrected misstatements, includes both known and projected misstatements that management has not corrected.
Wrong (B): The schedule of findings and questioned costs is specific to governmental audits under GAGAS and the Uniform Guidance, not the standard used in all financial statement audits.
Wrong (C): A report on internal control deficiencies addresses control weaknesses under AU-C 265, not the listing of uncorrected financial statement misstatements.
