  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 450.05, misstatements are clearly trivial when they are inconsequential both individually and in the aggregate. At $175 against $250,000 materiality (less than 0.1%), this amount is well below any reasonable threshold and need not be accumulated on the summary of uncorrected misstatements.
Wrong (B): Accumulation is required for misstatements above the clearly trivial threshold. A $175 error against $250,000 materiality falls below that threshold.
