UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 265.A19, while the auditor is not required to verify management''s corrective actions, responding to the audit committee''s request to evaluate a remediation plan is an appropriate professional service. The auditor should assess whether the proposed actions and timeline reasonably address the identified weakness.
Wrong (B): The auditor should not endorse the plan in writing. Evaluating and communicating concerns is appropriate, but endorsing management''s plan could impair independence.
