-- Q6166: Misstatements and Control Deficiencies [medium/L3]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under AU-C 450.14, although the auditor obtains management''s written representation regarding the immateriality of uncorrected misstatements, this does not substitute for the auditor''s own independent evaluation. The auditor must assess whether $48,000 against $60,000 materiality warrants opinion modification.
Wrong (A): Management''s representation does not conclusively resolve the evaluation. It is one input to the auditor''s judgment, not a definitive determination of immateriality.
Wrong (B): The representation does not shift responsibility from the auditor to management. The auditor retains independent responsibility for evaluating the aggregate effect of misstatements.
